<title>USA: Citicorp buys back 8.1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Citicorp buys back 8.1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citicorp said Tuesday it generated an estimated $800 milllion of free capital during the fourth quarter, and repurchased 8.1 million shares of common stock for $820 million.</p>
<p>Earlier, the company reported net income for the quarter of $987 million and $3.8 billion for the year, both up 9 percent over the comparable 1995 periods.</p>
<p>Earnings per diluted common share were $1.97 for the quarter and $7.42 for the year, both up 15 percent over the 1995 periods.</p>
</text>
